# The edge through the Russian node amf (task 109, ADR 0072 §8,
# docs/ops/edge.md, docs/ops/ru-node.md): PLUMA_RU_EDGE_DOMAIN
# (ru.sckra.dev) points at the node, whose nginx passes the TLS of the
# client as it came, behind PROXY v1, through the plumaru tunnel to port
# 8443 here (docker-compose.ru.yaml publishes it on home's tunnel address
# alone). TLS ends here, with home's
# certificate: the node sees only TLS. /apiws carries the clients' MTProto to
# the gateway's Edge entry (gnetway:11445, on teamgram_net only); the rest is
# the web client, as on PLUMA_WEB_DOMAIN.
#
# The Caddyfile imports this file only when PLUMA_RU_EDGE_DOMAIN is set
# (docker-compose.web.yaml): a site with an empty address would stop the
# whole Caddyfile. Its server, :8443, takes PROXY v1 from the node's address
# in the tunnel only and refuses any other connection (the servers option of
# the Caddyfile).
#
# - No secret, unlike the Gcore origin: that only the node reaches the port,
#   and Caddy believes the PROXY header from the node alone, is the guard.
#   The client's address is the one of the PROXY header, which Caddy makes
#   the remote address of the request; it goes to the gateway in
#   X-Pluma-Client-Addr, and X-Pluma-Edge-Via says ru. Both replace what a
#   client may have sent under those names.
# - Caddy takes the PROXY header from the node, but does not require it
#   (proxy_protocol's policy for an allowed source): a request from the
#   node without one would come from the node's own address, and is aborted
#   here, so no client is ever counted under the node's address.
# - No log directive, so no access log; neither Server nor Via in the
#   answers, Caddy's own errors (502 while the gateway is down) included.
{$PLUMA_RU_EDGE_DOMAIN}:8443 {
	@unwrapped remote_ip {$PLUMA_RU_EDGE_PROXY_FROM}
	route {
		abort @unwrapped
		handle /apiws {
			reverse_proxy gnetway:11445 {
				header_up X-Pluma-Client-Addr {http.request.remote.host}
				header_up X-Pluma-Edge-Via ru
			}
		}
		handle {
			root * /srv
			encode zstd gzip
			file_server
		}
	}
	header {
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
		X-Content-Type-Options nosniff
		Referrer-Policy no-referrer
		-Server
		-Via
	}
	handle_errors {
		header -Server
	}
}
